// SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
// tools/fui/mobile_main.fi -- lib/fui/mobile.fi: the mobile components (app bar, card, list tile, chips, segmented, bottom nav, text field,
// bubbles, pill, empty state): sizes, taps, group state, errors, safe area, rule budget, and the pictures `appmobile_components`.
//
//     mobile            checks only
//     mobile <dir>      also writes appmobile_components-light.png / -dark.png into <dir>
//
